+
+Regarding competitiveness: countries that lead on green technology gain tremendous competitive advantages. Strategic government investment—like what we've seen with successful industrial policies—can simultaneously drive innovation and protect workers. This isn't about accepting job losses; it's about proactive, collective planning through government programs.
+
